title Loan Eligibility Engine - deployed on AWS
direction right

// Outside AWS
Browser [icon: monitor]
Lender sites [icon: globe]
Gemini API [icon: google-gemini]
Test inbox [icon: mail]

// AWS
AWS ap-southeast-2 [icon: aws] {
  API Gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway]
  Lambda ui [icon: aws-lambda]
  S3 upload bucket [icon: aws-s3]
  SES [icon: aws-ses]

  VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {
    Lambda get_upload_url [icon: aws-lambda]
    Lambda get_status [icon: aws-lambda]
    Lambda process_csv [icon: aws-lambda]
    Lambda migrate [icon: aws-lambda]
    RDS PostgreSQL [icon: aws-rds]

    n8n on EC2 [icon: aws-ec2] {
      A Product discovery [icon: n8n]
      B User matching [icon: n8n]
      C Notification [icon: n8n]
    }
  }
}

// Upload path
Browser > API Gateway: 1 request upload link
API Gateway > Lambda ui: page
API Gateway > Lambda get_upload_url: link
API Gateway > Lambda get_status: poll status
Lambda get_upload_url > RDS PostgreSQL: uploads row
Lambda get_status > RDS PostgreSQL: read status
Browser > S3 upload bucket: 2 presigned POST
S3 upload bucket > Lambda process_csv: 3 object created
Lambda process_csv > RDS PostgreSQL: 4 upsert users
Lambda process_csv > B User matching: 5 webhook
Lambda migrate > RDS PostgreSQL: schema

// n8n workflows
A Product discovery > Lender sites: daily crawl
A Product discovery > Gemini API: extract products
A Product discovery > RDS PostgreSQL: loan_products
B User matching > RDS PostgreSQL: funnel SQL
B User matching > C Notification: 6 on completion
C Notification > RDS PostgreSQL: read and mark notified
C Notification > SES: 7 send email
SES > Test inbox
